  The following Bodh packages are adapted from ardanlabs/service:

    pkg/sqldb/        adapts business/sdk/sqldb (sqldb.go, tran.go) to a
                      pgx/v5 pgxpool-backed wrapper that preserves the
                      Beginner / CommitRollbacker transaction seam.
    pkg/sqldb/dialect adapts business/sdk/sqldb/dialect/ (the Dialect
                      interface + Postgres pagination helper).
    pkg/sqldb/dbarray adapts business/sdk/sqldb/dbarray/ (pgx-friendly
                      Postgres array Scanner/Valuer). That file itself
                      was originally taken from github.com/lib/pq (MIT)
                      and that nested attribution is preserved in the
                      file headers.
    pkg/migrate/      adapts business/sdk/migrate/migrate.go to an
                      embed.FS-backed numeric-prefix migrator with
                      schema_migrations bookkeeping and a per-migration
                      audit_events row (HIPAA §164.312(b)).
    pkg/errs/         adapts app/sdk/errs (ErrCode, Error, FieldErrors)
                      with Bodh-specific codes: HITLPending (202),
                      SafetyRefusal (422), PolicyDenied (403).
    pkg/web/          adapts foundation/web (App, HandlerFunc, Middleware)
                      for the Bodh HTTP surface.
    pkg/mid/          adapts foundation/web/middleware (Errors, Logger,
                      Metrics, Panics, Otel) plus authen.go / authorize.go
                      for JWT + OPA auth middleware.
    pkg/auth/         adapts app/sdk/auth (Authenticator, KeyStore, Claims,
                      OPA Rego policies) for RS256 JWT + OPA authorization.
    zarf/k8s/         adapts zarf/k8s/base/sales/ + dev/sales/ + prod
                      overlay pattern; Bodh deltas: PodSecurity restricted,
                      Workload Identity SA seam, default-deny NetworkPolicy,
                      PDB minAvailable=1, Cloud SQL Auth Proxy in prod.
    zarf/compose/     adapts zarf/compose/docker_compose.yaml +
                      pg_hba.conf for the Bodh local-dev stack (care +
                      Ollama + Prometheus + Grafana + Tempo + Loki).
    zarf/docker/      adapts zarf/docker/dockerfile.sales for
                      Dockerfile.care, Dockerfile.bodhctl,
                      Dockerfile.bodhadmin (distroless final stage).
    zarf/keys/        adapts the zarf/keys/ layout + naming convention
                      (UUID-keyed PEM files for JWT key rotation).
    cmd/bodhadmin/    adapts app/tooling/auth/ (keys + token subcommands)
                      for RSA keypair generation + dev/test JWT minting.

